  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe Guide Mode \"Block List\" has more features than the normal Quick Menu Here Tab, some of which would also really use full even for normal people. \n\nThings Guide Mode has which are missing in the Here Tab:  \n\n- It's sorted by Location instead of by Name / Friend Status  \n\n- You can see peoples VRC+ Icon  \n\n- You can see who is currently Talking\n\n# Suggestion:  \n\nAdd a few of these things to the normal Here Tab, as I think some of these things would also be appreciated by normal people / users and not just beginners.  \n\nBeing able to change how the Here Tab is sorted would be great! Especially if you could set it to distance as it would make it a lot easier to find people close to you.\n\nBeing able to see the VRC+ Icon would also be great, as it makes it easier to find someone if you have seen their nameplate before.\n\nOne thing which I'm not sure about however is the talking indicator, while it might be nice to have I think it could be a bit too much for the Here Tab.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nThe first picture shows the Blocked List of the Guide Menu while the second one shows the normal Here Tab:",
